{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;\u2014To fade away... was it hope for you and me, or despair?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300eNientum \u2013 Op.Zero\u300f</strong> is a 2D action-adventure music game that combines platformer, action, and adventure elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune the stage through musical interactions and experience a unique journey to breathe life back into a theater that has settled in a gray stillness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Strange Play Created Without Memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.poster.avif?t=1764170428\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.webm?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.mp4?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A theater once filled with songs and stories is now filled only with silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this desolate place, Aleph and Liora, who have lost their memories, become the Director and the Actress to raise the curtain on a new play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a stage that is beautiful yet foreboding, warm yet sorrowful, they discover lost clues one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truth will they face in the final scene of this play? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare the Stage Through Action \u2014 The Power of 'Tuning'</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/fa08426cbf562f5630cd0485af4686e7.poster.avif?t=1764170428\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/fa08426cbf562f5630cd0485af4686e7.webm?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/fa08426cbf562f5630cd0485af4686e7.mp4?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gems scattered throughout the stages are fragments of broken notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Aleph\u2019s ability to tune them, play their restored notes, and restore stage devices to complete the preparations for the performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As platforming, puzzles, and action naturally intertwine, the theater begins to regain its vitality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Performance Unfolds on the Stage You Tuned</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.poster.avif?t=1764170428\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.webm?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.mp4?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard of Oz, Cinderella, The Legend of King Arthur...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar tales are reinterpreted, and sometimes twisted, into musicals that unfold before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each of Liora\u2019s successful performances, a fresh glow of life returns to the theater. And their journey continues to the next act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Truth Brought to Light \u2014 Endings Shaped by Your Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/3841fb49fcc0822f25a75a6e595ac2a3.poster.avif?t=1764170428\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/3841fb49fcc0822f25a75a6e595ac2a3.webm?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/3841fb49fcc0822f25a75a6e595ac2a3.mp4?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nightmares and hope, wishes and despair, new encounters and farewells.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fragments of memory lost by Aleph and Liora are revealed one by one, following your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the direction of your choices, the end of the story takes a completely different turn, drastically altering their fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please, join them in their journey and help raise the curtain on this strange play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Music and Voices that Bring the Stage to Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage is filled with music composed by renowned artists such as<br><strong>Kagetora., Halv, and seatrus</strong>, delivering a deeply immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main characters\u2014including Aleph and Liora\u2014are brought to life by talented voice actors such as<br><strong>Chika Anzai, Yuuki Takada, and Takehito Koyasu</strong>, vividly expressing the beauty and strangeness of the theater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Director's Room:</strong> A space where you can record and view the various collectibles gathered while completing the play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Play Mode:</strong> A dedicated mode where you can enjoy tracks built with the rhythm-action expertise of Quesera Games, separate from the main story.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2725250?t=1764170428","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/f4f53643c4524a7b5deace4d3c47d76766308388/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764170428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/5d3cfcc2d00c057b1d888c3f69d0e41fae6c3be6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764170428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/5d3cfcc2d00c057b1d888c3f69d0e41fae6c3be6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764170428","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>&lt;\uac8c\uc784 \ucf58\ud150\uce20 \uc81c\uc791 \ubc0f \uc2a4\ud2b8\ub9ac\ubc0d \uac00\uc774\ub4dc&gt;</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Nientum - Op.ZERO&quot; allows full freedom for content creation and streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All music included in the Early Access version does not use copyright-matching systems, so streaming and video monetization are permitted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any other inquiries related to the game, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:contact@queseragames.com\">contact@queseragames.com</a>.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;\u2014To fade away... was it hope for you and me, or despair?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300eNientum \u2013 Op.Zero\u300f</strong> is a 2D action-adventure music game that combines platformer, action, and adventure elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune the stage through musical interactions and experience a unique journey to breathe life back into a theater that has settled in a gray stillness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Strange Play Created Without Memories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.poster.avif?t=1764170428\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.webm?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.mp4?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A theater once filled with songs and stories is now filled only with silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this desolate place, Aleph and Liora, who have lost their memories, become the Director and the Actress to raise the curtain on a new play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a stage that is beautiful yet foreboding, warm yet sorrowful, they discover lost clues one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truth will they face in the final scene of this play? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare the Stage Through Action \u2014 The Power of 'Tuning'</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/fa08426cbf562f5630cd0485af4686e7.poster.avif?t=1764170428\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/fa08426cbf562f5630cd0485af4686e7.webm?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/fa08426cbf562f5630cd0485af4686e7.mp4?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gems scattered throughout the stages are fragments of broken notes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Aleph\u2019s ability to tune them, play their restored notes, and restore stage devices to complete the preparations for the performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As platforming, puzzles, and action naturally intertwine, the theater begins to regain its vitality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Performance Unfolds on the Stage You Tuned</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.poster.avif?t=1764170428\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.webm?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.mp4?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard of Oz, Cinderella, The Legend of King Arthur...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar tales are reinterpreted, and sometimes twisted, into musicals that unfold before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each of Liora\u2019s successful performances, a fresh glow of life returns to the theater. And their journey continues to the next act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Truth Brought to Light \u2014 Endings Shaped by Your Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/3841fb49fcc0822f25a75a6e595ac2a3.poster.avif?t=1764170428\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/3841fb49fcc0822f25a75a6e595ac2a3.webm?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/extras/3841fb49fcc0822f25a75a6e595ac2a3.mp4?t=1764170428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nightmares and hope, wishes and despair, new encounters and farewells.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fragments of memory lost by Aleph and Liora are revealed one by one, following your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the direction of your choices, the end of the story takes a completely different turn, drastically altering their fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please, join them in their journey and help raise the curtain on this strange play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Music and Voices that Bring the Stage to Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage is filled with music composed by renowned artists such as<br><strong>Kagetora., Halv, and seatrus</strong>, delivering a deeply immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main characters\u2014including Aleph and Liora\u2014are brought to life by talented voice actors such as<br><strong>Chika Anzai, Yuuki Takada, and Takehito Koyasu</strong>, vividly expressing the beauty and strangeness of the theater.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Director's Room:</strong> A space where you can record and view the various collectibles gathered while completing the play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Play Mode:</strong> A dedicated mode where you can enjoy tracks built with the rhythm-action expertise of Quesera Games, separate from the main story.</p>","developers":["QueseraGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725250/29049beddb4ece7370fc561f5fa8fedd9e133c6b/header.jpg?t=1764170428","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2725250/1781668887/b75e6b0c0339efc51fd88ebdac3a261b9679d666/1763377878/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763447245","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2725250/1781668887/b75e6b0c0339efc51fd88ebdac3a261b9679d666/1763377878/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763447245","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2725250/1781668887/b75e6b0c0339efc51fd88ebdac3a261b9679d666/1763377878/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763447245","id":257233232,"name":"Nientum Early Access Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257233232/298f400190bc0aecb58a2057b59b282656a26948/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763447245"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2725250/156369759